  "prefLabel": "He-P 3202.04 Nutritional Risk",
  "priorExpiration": "1994-10-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 3202.04 Nutritional Risk.\n\n(a) An applicant shall be eligible to participate in the program if the applicant is at nutritional risk as defined by 7 CFR 246.2.\n\n(b) An applicant shall be deemed to be at nutritional risk if a competent professional authority determines that the applicant has any of the conditions listed in 7 CFR 246.7(e).\n\nSource. #4518, eff 10-28-88; EXPIRED 10-28-94\n\nNew. #6226, eff 4-24-96; ss by #7489, eff 5-11-01; ss by #7774, eff 10-8-02; ss by #8580, eff 3-11-06; ss by #9556, eff 10-1-09; ss by #10583, eff 10-1-14; ss by #12858, eff 8-23-19",
